{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20345","headline":"城南 · 张籍","name":"城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漾漾南涧水，来作曲池流。\n言寻参差岛，晓榜轻盈舟。\n万绕不再止，千寻尽孤幽。\n藻涩讶人重，萍分指鱼游。\n繁苗毯下垂，密箭翻回輈。\n曝鼈乱自坠，阴藤斜相钩。\n卧蒋黑米吐，翻芰紫角稠。\n桥低竞俯偻，亭近闲夷犹。\n目爲逐胜朗，手因掇芳柔。\n渐喜游来极，忽疑归无由。\n气状虽可览，纤微谅难搜。\n未听主人赏，徒爱清华秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}